    "reason": "Current PyPI release advisory metadata invalidates four versions carried forward from TensorFlow 2.21.0's March 2026 Python 3.11 lock: requests 2.32.4, idna 3.10, urllib3 2.6.3 and wheel 0.41.3. The runtime set is security-refreshed within the already-declared dependency ranges instead of executing stale locked versions. wheel 0.48.0 adds packaging>=24.0, so packaging is coherently rebased from 23.2 to current stable 26.3. This closes only the identified stale-version security repair; execution remains fail-closed pending complete platform-wheel, native/license/notice, security and artifact-to-source closure."
  },
